{
  "note": "The real mission list, from Category:Main Objectives on helldivers.wiki.gg. Each mission carries the fronts it appears on and the traits a scoring rule keys on. The traits are ours; the names and the faction split are not.",
  "source": "helldivers.wiki.gg",
  "licence": "CC BY-NC-SA 4.0",
  "traits": {
    "standard": {
      "name": "Standard operation",
      "line": "A full length mission with a main objective and whatever else you find on the way. Nothing here pushes your loadout in a particular direction, so bring what the front and the planet ask for."
    },
    "nest": {
      "name": "Structure demolition",
      "line": "The objective is a building or a hole and it has to come down. Anything that closes one from your own kit saves you a call-in, and you will need several of them."
    },
    "blitz": {
      "name": "Blitz",
      "line": "Destroy every nest or fabricator on the map before the clock runs out. Speed beats staying power: you want things that flatten a structure the moment you arrive, not things that win a long fight."
    },
    "wave": {
      "name": "Eradicate",
      "line": "One small arena, a kill count, and no room to run. Sustained crowd clear and things you can plant and leave earn their slot here more than anywhere else."
    },
    "defend": {
      "name": "Hold the line",
      "line": "You are standing on ground you cannot give up while it is attacked. Sentries, mines and emplacements finally get to sit still long enough to pay for themselves."
    },
    "evacuate": {
      "name": "Escort",
      "line": "Civilians have to cross open ground and they will walk into anything in the way. Smoke breaks the line of sight along their route, and area denial keeps the pressure off the path rather than off you."
    },
    "carry": {
      "name": "Carry",
      "line": "You pick something up and walk it across the map. It occupies a hand, so a one handed weapon lets you shoot while carrying and everything else means putting the objective down first."
    },
    "hvt": {
      "name": "High value target",
      "line": "A set number of named heavies and nothing else counts. Anti-tank is the whole loadout question; chaff clear is only there so you can reach them."
    },
    "commando": {
      "name": "Commando",
      "line": "Behind enemy lines with almost no Super Destroyer. You get one minute to call stratagems when you land and one return per Helldiver after that, and zero reinforcements until you find the pods: twelve in all, however many of you there are. Bring what lasts, and stay quiet, because every bot that calls for help makes the whole map worse."
    }
  },
